  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At an upscale French restaurant, Poseidon president Ikezawa treats his roster of actresses—including a nervous newcomer—to a refined meal before casually mentioning an intriguing video he watched recently. Listen to Ikezawa, Kaede, and the newcomer in Japanese first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "うまいな、上品な味だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "有名レストランからのれん分けされたお店のようです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "のれん分けってのは信用に足る店かどうかの目安になるからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "どうした、食べないのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "すいません、緊張してまして。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "硬くなる必要ないだろう、みんな身内なんだから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "じゃあ、こないだ観た面白い作品の話をしてやろう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "どんな作品ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "見たことない体位で男女が絡んでてな、その女優が伸び伸び演技してんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "よーく見たらな、うちの女優だったんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "かわいそうだけど、あの子は一生終わることになるな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "泣くんじゃない、食事がまずくなる。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "うまいな、上品な味だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Delicious — what a refined flavor.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kaede",
      "t": "有名レストランからのれん分けされたお店のようです。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It appears to be an authorized branch spun off from a famous restaurant.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "のれん分けってのは信用に足る店かどうかの目安になるからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A proper branch pedigree serves as a reliable measure of whether an establishment can be trusted.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "どうした、食べないのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What's the matter — aren't you eating?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "すいません、緊張してまして。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I'm so sorry, I'm just awfully nervous.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "硬くなる必要ないだろう、みんな身内なんだから。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No need to stiffen up like that; everyone at this table is family.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "じゃあ、こないだ観た面白い作品の話をしてやろう。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Now then, let me tell you about an amusing video I watched the other day.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "client_f",
      "t": "どんな作品ですか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What sort of video was it?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "見たことない体位で男女が絡んでてな、その女優が伸び伸び演技してんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A couple was tangled in a position I'd never seen before, and the actress performed so freely.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "よーく見たらな、うちの女優だったんだよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When I looked closely, though, she turned out to be one of our own actresses.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "かわいそうだけど、あの子は一生終わることになるな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pity as it is, that girl's entire life is going to be over now.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "泣くんじゃない、食事がまずくなる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Stop crying — you'll spoil the meal.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
